module lib/basis/pople631g
  The 6-31G basis set for hydrogen through argon, as a `Basis` table
  (lib/basis/basis). Generated by tools/basis_tables.py from the Basis Set
  Exchange; to change it, change the generator and rerun it. The water story
  uses this set.

basis_631g_shells_flat  @2eb42137
  why   The shell table as one literal list, the form the generator writes
        and the compiler reads fastest; basis_631g turns it into rows.

basis_631g_prims_flat  @94ab595d
  why   The primitive table as one literal list; a shell's primitives are
        the rows from its `p0` on.

basis_631g  @36dc9a85
  why   The call a program makes to get this set, either directly or through
        basis_named("6-31g").

basis_631g_nao  @75d66080
  why   Written by the generator from its own count, so the test can compare
        the table's shells with it element by element: a shell dropped or
        duplicated in the table changes the count.
